{"id":"c00c9415a54ec7c7","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/892_相关逻辑_R.md","title":"892 相关逻辑 R","display":"892_相关逻辑_R","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<h1 id=\"892-相关逻辑-R\">892 相关逻辑 R</h1>\n<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\mathsf{At}\\)</span> 为固定可数无限命题原子集合。公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{fusion}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{fusion}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第 2 节定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 为这些构造子生成的最小闭包。其型别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{fusion}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{fusion}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A,A\\land B,A\\lor B,A\\to B,A\\circ B\">\\(\\neg A,A\\land B,A\\lor B,A\\to B,A\\circ B\\)</span> 分别表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\operatorname{and}(A,B),\\operatorname{or}(A,B),\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\operatorname{fusion}(A,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\operatorname{and}(A,B),\\operatorname{or}(A,B),\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\operatorname{fusion}(A,B)\\)</span>。R 在后文含相关蕴含的 B、C、I、W 公理与融合残余公理，并令 K 弱化公理族为空。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式与替换\">2. 公式与替换</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{fusion}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{fusion}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{fusion}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{fusion}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[\\sigma]\">\\(A[\\sigma]\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}(A)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{neg}(A[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}(A)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{neg}(A[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{and}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{and}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{and}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{or}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{or}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{or}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{or}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{imp}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{imp}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fusion}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{fusion}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fusion}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{fusion}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。定义绑定原子函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>固定新鲜原子选择函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(X)\\notin X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(X)\\notin X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对任一原子重命名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf R}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf R}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由于没有绑定名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf R}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf R}\\)</span> 均是捕获避免替换。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf R}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf R}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-公理族\">3. 公理族</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(B,C),\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\operatorname{imp}(A,C))):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(B,C),\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\operatorname{imp}(A,C))):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(B,C)),\\operatorname{imp}(B,\\operatorname{imp}(A,C))):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(B,C)),\\operatorname{imp}(B,\\operatorname{imp}(A,C))):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(A,A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(A,A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{W}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)),\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{W}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)),\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义格连接词公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land}=\n\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B),A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(B,\\operatorname{and}(A,B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land}=\n\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B),A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(B,\\operatorname{and}(A,B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor}=\n\\{\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{or}(A,B)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{imp}(B,\\operatorname{or}(A,B)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,C),\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(B,C),\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B),C))):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor}=\n\\{\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{or}(A,B)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{imp}(B,\\operatorname{or}(A,B)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,C),\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(B,C),\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B),C))):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义否定与分配公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\neg}=\n\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{neg}(B)),\n\\operatorname{imp}(B,\\operatorname{neg}(A))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{neg}(A)),A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\neg}=\n\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{neg}(B)),\n\\operatorname{imp}(B,\\operatorname{neg}(A))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{neg}(A)),A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{dist}}=\n\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{and}(A,\\operatorname{or}(B,C)),\n\\operatorname{or}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B),\\operatorname{and}(A,C))):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{dist}}=\n\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{and}(A,\\operatorname{or}(B,C)),\n\\operatorname{or}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B),\\operatorname{and}(A,C))):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义融合残余公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\circ}=\n\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{fusion}(A,B),C),\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(B,C))):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(B,C)),\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{fusion}(A,B),C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\circ}=\n\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{fusion}(A,B),C),\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(B,C))):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(B,C)),\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{fusion}(A,B),C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf R}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{W}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\neg}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{dist}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\circ}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf R}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{W}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\neg}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{dist}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\circ}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-分离规则\">4. 分离规则</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Frm}^n\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Frm}^n\\)</span>。分离规则关系为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 的子集：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}=\\{((A,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B));B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}=\\{((A,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B));B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义证明步标签集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Lbl}_{\\mathsf R}=\n\\{\\mathsf{hyp},\\mathsf{axB},\\mathsf{axC},\\mathsf{axI},\\mathsf{axW},\\mathsf{axLand},\\mathsf{axLor},\\mathsf{axNeg},\\mathsf{axDist},\\mathsf{axFusion}\\}\n\\cup\\{ \\mathsf{mp}(j,k):j,k\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Lbl}_{\\mathsf R}=\n\\{\\mathsf{hyp},\\mathsf{axB},\\mathsf{axC},\\mathsf{axI},\\mathsf{axW},\\mathsf{axLand},\\mathsf{axLor},\\mathsf{axNeg},\\mathsf{axDist},\\mathsf{axFusion}\\}\n\\cup\\{ \\mathsf{mp}(j,k):j,k\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义标签验证谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Step}_{\\mathsf R}(\\Gamma,\\pi,\\lambda,U,i)\">\\(\\operatorname{Step}_{\\mathsf R}(\\Gamma,\\pi,\\lambda,U,i)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1})\">\\(\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda:n\\to\\mathsf{Lbl}_{\\mathsf R}\">\\(\\lambda:n\\to\\mathsf{Lbl}_{\\mathsf R}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U:n\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathbb N)\">\\(U:n\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathbb N)\\)</span>。它当且仅当满足下列某一分支：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{hyp}\\wedge A_i\\in\\Gamma\\wedge U(i)=\\{i\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{hyp}\\wedge A_i\\in\\Gamma\\wedge U(i)=\\{i\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axB}\\wedge A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}\\wedge U(i)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axB}\\wedge A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}\\wedge U(i)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axC}\\wedge A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{C}\\wedge U(i)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axC}\\wedge A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{C}\\wedge U(i)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axI}\\wedge A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}\\wedge U(i)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axI}\\wedge A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}\\wedge U(i)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axW}\\wedge A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{W}\\wedge U(i)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axW}\\wedge A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{W}\\wedge U(i)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axLand}\\wedge A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land}\\wedge U(i)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axLand}\\wedge A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land}\\wedge U(i)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axLor}\\wedge A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor}\\wedge U(i)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axLor}\\wedge A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor}\\wedge U(i)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axNeg}\\wedge A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\neg}\\wedge U(i)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axNeg}\\wedge A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\neg}\\wedge U(i)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axDist}\\wedge A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{dist}}\\wedge U(i)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axDist}\\wedge A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{dist}}\\wedge U(i)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axFusion}\\wedge A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\circ}\\wedge U(i)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{axFusion}\\wedge A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\circ}\\wedge U(i)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>或存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{mp}(j,k)\\wedge ((A_j,A_k);A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}\n\\wedge U(i)=U(j)\\cup U(k)\\cup\\{j,k\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{mp}(j,k)\\wedge ((A_j,A_k);A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}\n\\wedge U(i)=U(j)\\cup U(k)\\cup\\{j,k\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HypIdx}_{\\mathsf R}(\\lambda,n)=\\{i&lt;n:\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{hyp}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Prem}_{\\mathsf R}(\\pi,\\lambda,n)=\n\\{A_i:i\\in\\operatorname{HypIdx}_{\\mathsf R}(\\lambda,n)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HypIdx}_{\\mathsf R}(\\lambda,n)=\\{i&lt;n:\\lambda(i)=\\mathsf{hyp}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Prem}_{\\mathsf R}(\\pi,\\lambda,n)=\n\\{A_i:i\\in\\operatorname{HypIdx}_{\\mathsf R}(\\lambda,n)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义显式 relevance trace</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RelTrace}_{\\mathsf R}(\\Gamma,\\pi,\\lambda,U)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\forall i&lt;n\\,\\operatorname{Step}_{\\mathsf R}(\\Gamma,\\pi,\\lambda,U,i)\\bigr)\n\\wedge \\operatorname{Prem}_{\\mathsf R}(\\pi,\\lambda,n)=\\Gamma\n\\wedge \\operatorname{HypIdx}_{\\mathsf R}(\\lambda,n)\\subseteq U(n-1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RelTrace}_{\\mathsf R}(\\Gamma,\\pi,\\lambda,U)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\forall i&lt;n\\,\\operatorname{Step}_{\\mathsf R}(\\Gamma,\\pi,\\lambda,U,i)\\bigr)\n\\wedge \\operatorname{Prem}_{\\mathsf R}(\\pi,\\lambda,n)=\\Gamma\n\\wedge \\operatorname{HypIdx}_{\\mathsf R}(\\lambda,n)\\subseteq U(n-1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-证明序列\">5. 证明序列</h1>\n<p>给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Frm})\">\\(\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Frm})\\)</span>，R 证明是非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>连同标签函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda:n\\to\\mathsf{Lbl}_{\\mathsf R}\">\\(\\lambda:n\\to\\mathsf{Lbl}_{\\mathsf R}\\)</span> 与支撑追踪 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U:n\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathbb N)\">\\(U:n\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathbb N)\\)</span> 组成三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\pi,\\lambda,U)\">\\((\\pi,\\lambda,U)\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0\\)</span>、每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RelTrace}_{\\mathsf R}(\\Gamma,\\pi,\\lambda,U)\">\\(\\operatorname{RelTrace}_{\\mathsf R}(\\Gamma,\\pi,\\lambda,U)\\)</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf R}(\\Gamma,A)\">\\(\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf R}(\\Gamma,A)\\)</span> 为所有满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{n-1}=A\">\\(A_{n-1}=A\\)</span> 的三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\pi,\\lambda,U)\">\\((\\pi,\\lambda,U)\\)</span> 的集合。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-可导性\">6. 可导性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf R}A\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf R}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf R}A\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf R}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义证明证书集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf R}(\\Gamma,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf R}(\\Gamma,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf R}(\\Gamma,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf R}(\\Gamma,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf R}(\\Gamma,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf R}(\\Gamma,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf R}(\\Gamma,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf R}(\\Gamma,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-定理集合\">7. 定理集合</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf R}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{\\mathsf R}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf R}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{\\mathsf R}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-目标差异\">8. 目标差异</h1>\n<p>本条目的目标差异是：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}=\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}=\\varnothing\\)</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{W}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{W}\\)</span> 非空，融合构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fusion}\">\\(\\operatorname{fusion}\\)</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\circ}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\circ}\\)</span> 与蕴含形成双向残余，并由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RelTrace}_{\\mathsf R}\">\\(\\operatorname{RelTrace}_{\\mathsf R}\\)</span> 强制假设相关性。</p>\n<p>R 的公理差异对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Struct}_{\\mathsf R}(\\mathsf K)=0,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Struct}_{\\mathsf R}(\\mathsf W)=1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Struct}_{\\mathsf R}(\\mathsf{fusion})=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Struct}_{\\mathsf R}(\\mathsf K)=0,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Struct}_{\\mathsf R}(\\mathsf W)=1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Struct}_{\\mathsf R}(\\mathsf{fusion})=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义相关融合残余目标</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Resid}_{\\mathsf R}(A,B,C)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{fusion}(A,B),C),\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(B,C)))\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\circ}\n\\wedge\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(B,C)),\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{fusion}(A,B),C))\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\circ}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Resid}_{\\mathsf R}(A,B,C)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{fusion}(A,B),C),\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(B,C)))\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\circ}\n\\wedge\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(B,C)),\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{fusion}(A,B),C))\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\circ}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf R}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Ax}_{B},\\mathsf{Ax}_{C},\\mathsf{Ax}_{I},\\mathsf{Ax}_{W},\\mathsf{Ax}_{K},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\neg},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{dist}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\circ},\\mathsf{Lbl}_{\\mathsf R},\\operatorname{RelTrace}_{\\mathsf R},\\operatorname{Struct}_{\\mathsf R},\\operatorname{Resid}_{\\mathsf R}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf R}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Ax}_{B},\\mathsf{Ax}_{C},\\mathsf{Ax}_{I},\\mathsf{Ax}_{W},\\mathsf{Ax}_{K},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\neg},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{dist}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\circ},\\mathsf{Lbl}_{\\mathsf R},\\operatorname{RelTrace}_{\\mathsf R},\\operatorname{Struct}_{\\mathsf R},\\operatorname{Resid}_{\\mathsf R}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf R}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Frm},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf R},\\operatorname{Sub},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf R},\\mathsf{Ax}_{B},\\mathsf{Ax}_{C},\\mathsf{Ax}_{I},\\mathsf{Ax}_{W},\\mathsf{Ax}_{K},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\neg},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{dist}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\circ},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf R},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to},\\mathsf{Lbl}_{\\mathsf R},\\operatorname{Step}_{\\mathsf R},\\operatorname{HypIdx}_{\\mathsf R},\\operatorname{Prem}_{\\mathsf R},\\operatorname{RelTrace}_{\\mathsf R},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf R},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf R},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf R},\\vdash_{\\mathsf R},\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf R},\\operatorname{Struct}_{\\mathsf R},\\operatorname{Resid}_{\\mathsf R},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf R}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf R}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Frm},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf R},\\operatorname{Sub},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf R},\\mathsf{Ax}_{B},\\mathsf{Ax}_{C},\\mathsf{Ax}_{I},\\mathsf{Ax}_{W},\\mathsf{Ax}_{K},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\neg},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{dist}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\circ},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf R},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to},\\mathsf{Lbl}_{\\mathsf R},\\operatorname{Step}_{\\mathsf R},\\operatorname{HypIdx}_{\\mathsf R},\\operatorname{Prem}_{\\mathsf R},\\operatorname{RelTrace}_{\\mathsf R},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf R},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf R},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf R},\\vdash_{\\mathsf R},\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf R},\\operatorname{Struct}_{\\mathsf R},\\operatorname{Resid}_{\\mathsf R},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf R}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只定义相关逻辑 R 的句法证明关系；不含 Routley-Meyer 语义、代数语义或元定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"892-相关逻辑-R","text":"892 相关逻辑 R","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式与替换","text":"2. 公式与替换","level":1},{"id":"3.-公理族","text":"3. 公理族","level":1},{"id":"4.-分离规则","text":"4. 分离规则","level":1},{"id":"5.-证明序列","text":"5. 证明序列","level":1},{"id":"6.-可导性","text":"6. 可导性","level":1},{"id":"7.-定理集合","text":"7. 定理集合","level":1},{"id":"8.-目标差异","text":"8. 目标差异","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{At}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{fusion}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf